   "id": "test_procedure",
   "label": "DOE test procedure",
   "type": "enum",
   "enum": [
    "appendix_j2",
    "appendix_j",
    "maker_unstated"
   ],
   "description": "Basis of capacity, IMEF, IWF and the annual figures. ES bghd-e2wd rows are 10 CFR 430 Subpart B Appendix J2 (the column descriptions cite J2; 295 loads/yr). DOE's 2022 test-procedure rule added a NEW Appendix J that reports different metrics (EER, WER, per-load) for the amended standards: J figures are never put under the IMEF / IWF keys and never compared with J2 ones."
  }
